{"_id":"45d58e528c0b9a46","name":"Ragnarok","type":"weapon","img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","system":{"category":"Axes","description":"This legendary greataxe, forged from the fires of war and turmoil, spreads destruction on a massive scale. Ragnarok’s damage is treated as dark against targets either immune, resistant, or weak to dark damage. Additionally, when you use the Cleave technick, the target(s) is moved -1 step on the Break Gauge for each explosive die. Targets cannot be moved to the bottom of the Break Gauge by this effect, unless the damage beat their Threshold. This is a death effect. Requires 15 Str to wield.","cost":40900,"availability":"Legendary","bulk":2,"weaponGroup":"axes","weaponSize":"Large","weaponSkill":"two-handed","attack":{"bonus":5},"damage":{"formula":"2d12+5","type":"Slashing"},"range":"Melee","capacity":0,"specialRules":"This legendary greataxe, forged from the fires of war and turmoil, spreads destruction on a massive scale. Ragnarok’s damage is treated as dark against targets either immune, resistant, or weak to dark damage. Additionally, when you use the Cleave technick, the target(s) is moved -1 step on the Break Gauge for each explosive die. Targets cannot be moved to the bottom of the Break Gauge by this effect, unless the damage beat their Threshold. This is a death effect. Requires 15 Str to wield.","prerequisites":{"str":15}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
